{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "4162df88ccbd4b9d65728a780c14cd3b0cf9b00fcf617839ee16be2329d7ef78", "ja": "頼れるふたり", "zh": "可靠的两人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "63ae7d944eda0d9792e28a98bdbb83ff9e5e0ac877eaaee1603efd29117511b7", "ja": "ゲネリハ当日、出番を待つジュリアと恵美。\n段取りを確認しようとするが、相変わらず\nプロデューサーは忙しくしている。もっと\n自分達を頼っていいと語り、ふたりは本番に\n向けて、気合いを高めるのだった。", "zh": "正式彩排当天，等待上场的茱莉亚和惠美。\n她们想确认一下流程，可制作人还是一如既往地\n忙个不停。两人告诉制作人，完全可以多依靠她们，\n并为正式演出鼓足了干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "42557eb54645012790536abf2fd0adff01e3ec779acf2f4d0efe06a8b09cbb78", "ja": "（ジュリアと恵美のデュオ公演が近づいてきた。\n今日はゲネリハ、本番前の大切な確認も多い……）", "zh": "（茱莉亚和惠美的双人公演就要开始了。今天是总彩排，还有很多正式演出前的重要确认事项……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "cdb933c360b0432b7229e2baf4aad9617ca171c2bbc1116c5ca1966ba12cab14", "ja": "やっほ！　{$P$}。\nアタシたちの準備はバッチリだよ～。", "zh": "嗨！{$P$}。\n我们这边已经彻底准备好啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1002_p", "source_sha256": "aa2ed3f6a1d423cde88f72f8264c4b350677546e6795a1379cb25089592c08f5", "ja": "おっ、ふたりともお疲れさま！\n衣装、いい感じだな。", "zh": "哦，两位都辛苦了！\n服装很不错嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "bae1e22fa9fad41f668d1d00c71ee7d1f9284fd4272d958919c48b36d48fe16c", "ja": "サンキュ！　衣装だけじゃなくて、\nパフォーマンスもいい感じだぜ？　ふふん♪", "zh": "谢谢！不只是服装，表演也很棒吧？哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b8f8cdb17e4817070ca4308b183a565907860042bf655173aa2be7ec6c1b3363", "ja": "ああ、期待してる！", "zh": "啊，我很期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "2017c23bafa2d6cfc1b83642a5f00ece59cfed68c452703c20a7fa8a60618983", "ja": "んで、{$P$}。\nこの後の段取り、ちょっと確認なんだけど……。", "zh": "然后啊，{$P$}。\n关于接下来的流程，想找你稍微确认一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1006_staff", "source_sha256": "147329f3f2110f42b654116924476cd291b4aceb0b558f84356dd2a45409439f", "ja": "すみませーん、{$P$}Pさん。\n照明の演出についてなんですけど……", "zh": "不好意思——，{$P$}P先生。\n是关于灯光演出的事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1007_staff", "source_sha256": "29f91d659fcea34ca7a18377ff2795fc43ab0b672d270393587e56bfb0a8bcfe", "ja": "{$P$}Pさん！\n曲順について、ちょっといいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}P先生！\n关于歌曲顺序，我能问一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "298b226c2f5bbb7e4601a7499526721f06c059cf378051b8e88d0d4ea4186492", "ja": "っとと……！？\nええと、その……ふたりとも、悪いんだけど……。", "zh": "等等……！？\n那个……怎么说呢……两位，抱歉……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "c850ac87fcdb9dfd914af2b213b267e929e9612f26123c17fc812a41c8825f91", "ja": "にゃはは♪　やっぱ忙しそうだね～。", "zh": "喵哈哈♪果然看起来很忙呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "0732a953e2acd8731c27a8dd2e9ff45e56b10a2332054eca4dc297081054dd00", "ja": "ったく、しょーがねえな……。\nこっちはいいから、早く行ってこいよ。", "zh": "真是的，没办法啊……  \n这边不用管了，快去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "3282e7de9c1e466e1a82df5e72537cc867a7fa064d17f5b465513466ac0b309f", "ja": "任せとけって。そのかわり、\nリハ見た後は、ちゃんと時間取っておけよな！", "zh": "交给我吧。作为交换，看完彩排后可得给我留出时间啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5e5d08c13d034666b1282f20788c8246ad6c3e3649091aeca330fd63f3d6e2af", "ja": "あ、ああ！　ゴメン、行ってくる！", "zh": "啊、啊！抱歉，我这就去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "bbb746d9b8b2f0a8be9ebb8da3dbc3fd360d811fdde21ab0f98350d2c6ff7358", "ja": "おやおや～？　ジュリア、\n聞き分けいいじゃん？　……なんてね♪", "zh": "哎呀呀～？茱莉亚，还挺听话的嘛？……开玩笑的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "2e59d5d46edd9f35ad6316da3c4d77081873a19d9424d879b8356b177703ac4a", "ja": "こちとら、拗ねるほどガキじゃないんでね。\nほらほら！　ウチらもスタンバイしとこうぜ。", "zh": "我可没幼稚到会因为这点事闹别扭。好了好了！咱们也准备待命吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "a53a3537dcde867c71f2bc093bb0bc5830bcc957180ab3a63085e27b48bd5750", "ja": "りょーかい♪　スタッフさんたちも\n夢中になっちゃうくらい、盛り上げようね！", "zh": "了解♪　让工作人员也沉浸其中，一起嗨起来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1017_p", "source_sha256": "eed1b48cfd34eb211050ac3c1909b710f3004880e31414b783c1abda5a4820bb", "ja": "ふぅ、やっと落ち着いた……。\nふたりとも、お疲れさま。バタバタしててゴメン。", "zh": "呼，终于平静下来了……。\n你们两个，辛苦了。刚才忙忙乱乱的，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "aec5c3406d3b75dcb431a01cb848effe8005e321061647d141ffc99012ef0715", "ja": "お疲れさま～！　別にいいってば。\n仕事なんだから。", "zh": "辛苦啦～！没事啦。\n本来就是工作嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "c50035d91b9151a518f491d6c2ecd72d993e71ec147a333479bc7e6735656fd8", "ja": "そうそう、気にすんなって。\nウチらのための仕事だしな。謝られることじゃない。", "zh": "对对，别在意啦。\n这也是为了咱们的工作嘛。没什么好道歉的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "b1c93569cf59ab8ab97d1fb140a32726ea3ddbe34c31a04f3944af1f25455832", "ja": "あ！　でも、いっこだけ……。", "zh": "啊！不过，就有一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7c59608752f267d6180b140d18e7d63d6eab88ec8f53b1bf3132cb2afda45b46", "ja": "うん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "b047e30cd13063cba3aaa8a0944a617cfc355d2d810d7a3c317763a37ff47340", "ja": "{$P$}、\nこれからも、キツい時はちゃんと頼って。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n今后遇到难熬的时候，要好好依靠我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "a40e91d229ffcecb43ee6d351829dc327f19afe93668b98c2eda9cb5a2f65f3e", "ja": "お仕事頑張ってくれてる分、\nアタシたちも全力で応えるから！　ね？", "zh": "你一直在努力工作，\n我们也会全力回应你的！对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "b132a4270c4e82809d4d0d8cf01709b2538dd600bde456410b266d10c05a413d", "ja": "じゃないと、また無理やりさらっちまうぜ？\n今度は帰れないかもな♪", "zh": "不然的话，我可要再强行把你掳走了哦？\n这次说不定就回不来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "175a31c849efd02687b2b2bc5bd06c50647dd9cf5ec5bc8ea38d475e9a8f0a2f", "ja": "はは……それは困るな。\nわかったよ、ありがとう。", "zh": "哈哈……那可就麻烦了。\n知道了，谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "62b726425712e546cba0c66fb5b799fbe4d4858c813521a50dc281801defefd5", "ja": "よし。それじゃ……こっからはウチらの仕事だ。\n本番、楽しみにしとけよ！", "zh": "好。那么……接下来就是我们的工作了。\n正式演出时可要好好期待啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "7aef494cfcd04860f34f09166871a1a0f07cf99f74e75dcbd717a8611378a4aa", "ja": "そゆこと！\n期待を上回っちゃうんで、よろしく～♪", "zh": "就是这样！\n我们会超出你的期待，敬请期待哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "387142530432afd5f995404d316dd43f214bf35f1749a0c938862865e970fda8", "ja": "（今回、ふたりに教えてもらった。\nちゃんと逃げること……心を自由にする方法を）", "zh": "（这次，她们两人教会了我。好好逃跑……以及让心灵获得自由的方法）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "3b3c4f7822fe192452339a064bc655fae8b350e5215e26a5d0c0c4715db2ced3", "ja": "（おかげで、いい仕事ができた。\n本番はきっと、最高のステージになるな！）", "zh": "（多亏了这些，工作完成得很顺利。本番一定会成为最棒的舞台！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
